    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'The first and the last slider must set to value 5.

    The sum of the
    values of the three middle sliders must equal 6.

    The difference between
    the fourth and fifth sliders (from left to right) must be the largest among all
    sliders.

    The second and third sliders (from left to right) must differ by
    one.'
